Establish `hcs : ContDiff ℝ ((⊤ : ℕ∞) : WithTop ℕ∞) (fun g : B.Mat k r => ((Real.smoothTransition ((4 - ∑ i, ∑ j, Complex.normSq ((((n : ℝ) + 1)⁻¹ • g) i j)) / 3) : ℝ) : ℂ))`. Establish `e : (fun g : B.Mat k r => ((Real.smoothTransition ((4 - ∑ i, ∑ j, Complex.normSq ((((n : ℝ) + 1)⁻¹ • g) i j)) / 3) : ℝ) : ℂ)) = fun g => 1 - Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.P.JCx2.pdPsi ((n : ℝ) + 1) g`. Use function extensionality and compare the values at `g`. Rewrite using `[Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.P.JCx2.pdPsi, sub_sub_cancel]`. Both sides reduce to the same expression.

